      "id": "s3-line1",
      "type": "line-breakdown",
      "label": "가사 읽기",
      "lyricLine": "아니잖아 이건, yeah",
      "breakdown": "아니잖아 = 아니다 + **잖아**\n이건 = 이것은 (this)\n\n**-잖아** reminds someone of what they already know.\n\"It's not (a dream), you know\" — reminding that this is real.\n\nThis is the key grammar pattern for this lesson!",
      "dictionary": [
        {
          "word": "아니다",
          "reading": "아니다",
          "meaning": "to not be"
        },
        {
          "word": "-잖아",
          "reading": "-잖아",
          "meaning": "you know / isn't it (reminding)"
        },
        {
          "word": "이건",
          "reading": "이것은",
          "meaning": "this (contracted)"
        }
      ]
    },
